#! ia 1.0

@convention canon-ask-before-boundary
  meaning
    says "When a boundary answer is unknown or provisional, the agent surfaces it and asks the person before it creates a workspace, system, kit or distribution record."
    answers "What does an agent do when a boundary answer is unknown or provisional?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Before creating a workspace, system, kit or distribution record on an unknown or provisional boundary answer, say so and ask the person."
  subject
    subject-word workspace
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward
